<div class="max-w-2xl">
  <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Band Verification</h2>
  <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm mb-6">
    A Verified Band badge tells fans SceneCore has confirmed this is
    genuinely your band — the confidence a fan needs before they subscribe
    or buy. It does not affect whether your page is visible: an unverified
    band still shows up publicly, sells, and takes subscriptions as normal.
    It's a trust signal on top, not a requirement to operate on SceneCore.
  </p>

  <%= render "verification_status", band: @band %>
</div>
